      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Hi Tupper.\nI experienced this at \"Test Pilots\" world at chopper landing.\nIt feels like \"wind shear\" or \"turbulence\"!\n>Step-by-step instructions to reproduce the problem:\n*visit https://en.vrcw.net/world/detail/wrld_e4908cea-023b-4749-9ad7-a898b12996e7\n*launch chopper\n*proceed to landing\n*about every 10 minutes, you can feel it!\nEnvironment:\nOculus Quest 2\nquest_2021.3.3p1-6c988150**\n(** is alphabet 2 characters)\nVRCHAT:Build 1129\n>Any other relevant information:\nMy friend in Japan also reported same at playing youtube on this assets.\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/2758684\nI've tested, it was true on this world:\nhttps://en.vrcw.net/world/detail/wrld_16c5f058-0462-4d5d-b1c5-bda0b50a870b\nI guess these reasons are the same, \"clock synchronization glitch\".\nAnd if you want more information about this, send friend to me in vrchat world or respond.\nGood day!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
