      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Hi Tupper.\nI've confirmed that no matter what avatar you wear and what world you are in, small freeze occurs once every 10 seconds, so I think that it is reproducible under all conditions. (Even if it's the default robot avatar in VRChat Home.)\nI'd also like to add a new piece of information: this problem only occurs in Quest2, not in Quest1.\nTherefore, it is highly unlikely that it is due to low CPU performance, suggesting other complex causes.\nThis problem is making it difficult for Quest2 users to communicate and is resulting in an unpleasant user experience.\nIf you understand the importance of this issue, please help us investigate the cause!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
